<https://moosedev.dev/kg/Alternative/8e673ace-dec0-410d-92fb-9dc032c33719> <https://trivyn.io/ontologies/software/architecture#hasLifecycleStatus> "accepted" <https://moosedev.dev/kg/project> .
<https://moosedev.dev/kg/Alternative/8e673ace-dec0-410d-92fb-9dc032c33719> <https://trivyn.io/ontologies/software/architecture#hasTimestamp> "2026-10-12T02:25:07.241488Z"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#dateTime> <https://moosedev.dev/kg/project> .
<https://moosedev.dev/kg/Alternative/8e673ace-dec0-410d-92fb-9dc032c33719> <https://trivyn.io/ontologies/software/architecture#hasTitle> "Panic in build.rs and ask MSVC users to set CC=clang-cl: explicit, but every MSVC consumer would have to configure it." <https://moosedev.dev/kg/project> .
<https://moosedev.dev/kg/Alternative/ef2a6d1e-41e1-4276-ab10-9789bcecfd8c> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://trivyn.io/ontologies/software/architecture#Alternative> <https://moosedev.dev/kg/project> .
<https://moosedev.dev/kg/Alternative/ef2a6d1e-41e1-4276-ab10-9789bcecfd8c> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Detect a plain cl.exe in build.rs (Tool::is_like_msvc && !is_like_clang_cl) and switch with build.compiler(\"clang-cl\"): more code than cc's built-in option and it would override an explicit CC." <https://moosedev.dev/kg/project> .
<https://moosedev.dev/kg/Alternative/ef2a6d1e-41e1-4276-ab10-9789bcecfd8c> <https://trivyn.io/ontologies/software/architecture#hasAuthor> "claude-code" <https://moosedev.dev/kg/project> .
