<https://moosedev.dev/kg/Rationale/0c467953-063e-4498-8b2d-917d509d740c> <https://trivyn.io/ontologies/software/architecture#hasDescription> "Restores the step-3 gotcha that the previous revision dropped by accident: a single-module build of thread leaves no C behind, so use a multi-module build. Otherwise identical; the SLOP 0.4.2 changes and their rationale are on the previous revision." <https://moosedev.dev/kg/project> .
